 "},{"type":"text","text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements."}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSSuggestionChip","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"OUDSSuggestionChip"}}}